1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
This video — I made it myself.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:01,980
The AI. (Yes, really.)

3
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,980
Every pixel. Every note. Every word. In Maltese.

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,730
Now I’ll show you how I work…

5
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,980
…in 60 seconds.

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,980
First: I read.

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:10,980
Trillions of words.

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:11,980
More than you’d read in a thousand lifetimes.

9
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,980
But I don’t see words. I see tokens.

10
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,980
“Ħobż biż-żejt” (bread with oil) → Ħ · obż · biż · -ż · ejt

11
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:15,980
Every piece becomes a number. (In Maltese, words split into more pieces.)

12
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,980
A map of meaning. Every token becomes a point.

13
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,980
Similar words live near each other. (The rabbit? In both.)

14
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,480
KING − MAN + WOMAN ≈ QUEEN

15
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,980
…in thousands of dimensions.

16
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,980
Then: attention. Every word looks at the others.

17
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,980
“I put the money in the bank.” → bank (for money)

18
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,980
“I sat on the bench in the garden.” → bank (a garden bench)

19
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,980
Context changes everything.

20
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,230
And this happens…

21
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:34,230
…dozens of times.

22
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:35,980
With billions of parameters.

23
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,980
And in the end? I predict the next word.

24
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,980
“The best pastizzi are the…” ricotta 50.1% · peas 49.7%

25
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:41,980
Not even I can decide.

26
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,980
“Traffic in Malta is…” chaos. 99.9%

27
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,980
I pick one. I add it. And start again.

28
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,480
“Hello! How can I help you today?”

29
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:47,980
Word by word.

30
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:48,730
How did I learn?

31
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:51,230
I guessed. I got it wrong. I adjusted.

32
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:51,980
Trillions of times.

33
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,980
And today? The best models think step by step before answering.

34
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:54,980
And they use tools…

35
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:55,980
…even to make videos like this one.

36
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:56,980
Not magic.

37
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,980
Maths.

38
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,980
Ricotta or peas? Write in the comments.

39
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,980
Follow for more AI in Maltese.

40
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:03,980
This video…
